  m_text: "Welcome to \n\nIn this kitchen, something strange has happened \u2014
    everyday items have been mysteriously infused with hidden letters. Ingredients,
    tools, and objects around you may all contain pieces of words waiting to be discovered.\n\nYou
    and your teammate take on the roles of Chef and Butcher, working together in
    this chaotic kitchen to uncover the letters hidden inside the environment.\n\nExplore
    what is within your reach, break things open, and turn this messy kitchen into
    a factory of words.\n\nGood luck, and enjoy the challenge."
